                <pb facs="0796" n="776" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg776"/>

                <head>[Telegraphic circular.]</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Collector of Customs at</hi> :</p>
                <p>Give particular attention to vessels clearing from your port; if any
                    circumstances indicate intention to violate neutrality laws, refuse clearance
                    and detain vessel, immediately reporting to this department and to the attorney
                    general.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Finance
                            Department,</hi>
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#italic">Quebec</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1864-11-08"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 8, 1864</date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
